{"id":"680f7bcce5dddc10","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-hyperimmune-bound.md","title":"超免疫的主函数表征","display":"thm-hyperimmune-bound — 超免疫的主函数表征","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-hyperimmune-bound","aliases":["20-thm-hyperimmune-bound"],"display":"thm-hyperimmune-bound — 超免疫的主函数表征","chapter":"5","section":"5.3.2","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 5.3.3","source_pdf_pages":[149],"source_printed_pages":[114],"depends_on":["[[20-df-hyperimmune]]","[[20-df-principal-function]]","[[20-df-domination]]","[[20-df-computable]]","[[20-df-finite-array]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-hyperimmune-bound"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-hyperimmune-bound</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-hyperimmune-bound — 超免疫的主函数表征"},{"key":"chapter","html":"5"},{"key":"section","html":"5.3.2"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 5.3.3"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>149</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>114</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"89b88563124855ce\" href=\"?note=89b88563124855ce\" title=\"20-df-hyperimmune\">20-df-hyperimmune</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"145fee39d6716fb8\" href=\"?note=145fee39d6716fb8\" title=\"20-df-principal-function\">20-df-principal-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2e0726b34b0b1c40\" href=\"?note=2e0726b34b0b1c40\" title=\"20-df-domination\">20-df-domination</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"352368d98a9342b6\" href=\"?note=352368d98a9342b6\" title=\"20-df-finite-array\">20-df-finite-array</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(B\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span> 无限；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_B(n)\">\\(p_B(n)\\)</span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n+1\">\\(n+1\\)</span> 小成员；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\">\\(\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\)</span> 是全可计算一元函数族，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_B\\le^*h\">\\(p_B\\le^*h\\)</span> 表示最终逐点不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\">\\(h\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"89b88563124855ce\" href=\"?note=89b88563124855ce\" title=\"20-df-hyperimmune\">20-df-hyperimmune</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"145fee39d6716fb8\" href=\"?note=145fee39d6716fb8\" title=\"20-df-principal-function\">20-df-principal-function</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"2e0726b34b0b1c40\" href=\"?note=2e0726b34b0b1c40\" title=\"20-df-domination\">20-df-domination</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"352368d98a9342b6\" href=\"?note=352368d98a9342b6\" title=\"20-df-finite-array\">20-df-finite-array</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}hyperimmune\\text{-}bound}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Hyperimmune}(B)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\neg\\exists h\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ [p_B\\le^*h].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}hyperimmune\\text{-}bound}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Hyperimmune}(B)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\neg\\exists h\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ [p_B\\le^*h].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>若存在击中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 的不交强数组 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span>，每列非空，能从完整有限码计算</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"h(n)=\\max\\bigcup_{j\\le n}F_j.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[h(n)=\\max\\bigcup_{j\\le n}F_j.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>不交性给并集中至少 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n+1\">\\(n+1\\)</span> 个不同的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 成员，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_B(n)\\le h(n)\">\\(p_B(n)\\le h(n)\\)</span>。完整有限码而非只枚举最终有限集，正是计算最大值的依据。</p>\n<p>反向设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_B\\le^*h\">\\(p_B\\le^*h\\)</span>。把有限例外的真实 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_B\">\\(p_B\\)</span> 值硬编码，可换成全可计算逐点上界 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat h\">\\(\\widehat h\\)</span>。令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_0=[0,\\widehat h(0)]\">\\(F_0=[0,\\widehat h(0)]\\)</span>；已有前若干列后，置 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k=1+\\max\\bigcup_{j\\le n}F_j\">\\(k=1+\\max\\bigcup_{j\\le n}F_j\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_{n+1}=[k,\\widehat h(k)]\">\\(F_{n+1}=[k,\\widehat h(k)]\\)</span>。由于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\le p_B(k)\\le\\widehat h(k)\">\\(k\\le p_B(k)\\le\\widehat h(k)\\)</span>，新区间非空且含一个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 成员。各区间两两不交，端点及完整有限码可计算，故形成强数组。两方向证明所示等价，也说明把最终界换成逐点界只影响有限常数，不产生新的统一性结论。</p>\n<p>来源：印刷 114 / PDF 149。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-hyperimmune","status":"resolved","id":"89b88563124855ce","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-hyperimmune]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-principal-function","status":"resolved","id":"145fee39d6716fb8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-principal-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-domination","status":"resolved","id":"2e0726b34b0b1c40","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-domination]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-finite-array","status":"resolved","id":"352368d98a9342b6","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-finite-array]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-hyperimmune","status":"resolved","id":"89b88563124855ce","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-hyperimmune]]；see [[20-df-principal-function]]；see [[20-df-domination]]；see [[20-df-computable]]；see [[20-df-finite-array]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-principal-function","status":"resolved","id":"145fee39d6716fb8","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-hyperimmune]]；see [[20-df-principal-function]]；see [[20-df-domination]]；see [[20-df-computable]]；see [[20-df-finite-array]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-domination","status":"resolved","id":"2e0726b34b0b1c40","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-hyperimmune]]；see [[20-df-principal-function]]；see [[20-df-domination]]；see [[20-df-computable]]；see [[20-df-finite-array]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-hyperimmune]]；see [[20-df-principal-function]]；see [[20-df-domination]]；see [[20-df-computable]]；see [[20-df-finite-array]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-finite-array","status":"resolved","id":"352368d98a9342b6","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-hyperimmune]]；see [[20-df-principal-function]]；see [[20-df-domination]]；see [[20-df-computable]]；see [[20-df-finite-array]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"B\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"p_B(n)","display":false},{"tex":"n+1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}","display":false},{"tex":"p_B\\le^*h","display":false},{"tex":"h","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}hyperimmune\\text{-}bound}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Hyperimmune}(B)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\neg\\exists h\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ [p_B\\le^*h].","display":true},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"h(n)=\\max\\bigcup_{j\\le n}F_j.","display":true},{"tex":"n+1","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"p_B(n)\\le h(n)","display":false},{"tex":"p_B\\le^*h","display":false},{"tex":"p_B","display":false},{"tex":"\\widehat h","display":false},{"tex":"F_0=[0,\\widehat h(0)]","display":false},{"tex":"k=1+\\max\\bigcup_{j\\le n}F_j","display":false},{"tex":"F_{n+1}=[k,\\widehat h(k)]","display":false},{"tex":"k\\le p_B(k)\\le\\widehat h(k)","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false}],"bytes":2028,"backlinks":[{"id":"f222b74804c56f9b","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-deficiency]]；see [[20-df-hypersimple]]；see [[20-df-truth-table]]；see [[20-df-principal-function]]；see [[20-thm-hyperimmune-bound]]。"},{"id":"ee204c4a529582bb","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-hyperimmune-free]]；see [[20-thm-hyperimmune-bound]]；see [[20-lem-principal-code]]。"},{"id":"cc21d215609a3083","anchor":"ref-17","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-closed-class]]；see [[20-df-basis]]；see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-K]]；see [[20-thm-simple-exists]]；see [[20-df-effective-immune]]；see [[20-thm-hyperimmune-bound]]；see [[20-df-finite-array]]；see [[20-thm-closed-class-tree-equivalence]]；see [[20-thm-effective-immune-ce-upper]]。"},{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-118","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-thm-hyperimmune-bound]] — 章 5；直接提供者 5 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-118","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-thm-hyperimmune-bound]]"}],"outgoing":["89b88563124855ce","145fee39d6716fb8","2e0726b34b0b1c40","e343870c773cb68e","352368d98a9342b6"]}